+    "(b,c)=(1,1),(1,2),(1,3); the generator deliberately uses the richest "
+    "cubic case. In its proof the two mutations permute coefficient roles by "
+    "(DG)(EF)(KL) and (AD)(BC)(FK)(GH), and the generated group has order "
