codex
A repository preflight exposed one harness-specific issue: although `n` already enlarges only the repetition haystack and never the answer, the static submit guard treats any `n`-only escalation as suspect. I’m making escalation also increase short base-word length up to the audited cap of 8; this is a genuine second fixed-witness hardness axis and keeps the compact route under 300 operations.
